# path.log — one day of the license, oldest at the top, newest at the bottom.
# Never rewrite an entry. A day that lands no change still appends. Commit is `-`.
# Format:
# YYYY-MM-DD | <commit> | <files> | <what> | checks <pass|n/a>
# The class in <what> is instrument (sapience, prn.c, pcn.c) or document (README.md, SAPIENCE.md).
# This job does not run the room test. checks are bash -n sapience and a compile of prn.c and pcn.c.
